她自己也在努力的过好自己的每一天
Tā zìjǐ yě zài nǔlì de guò hǎo zìjǐ de měi yī tiān
She’s also working hard to live her life well every day

376
00:17:41,933 --> 00:17:44,533
她也在继续的领导着
Tā yě zài jìxù de lǐngdǎo zhe
She’s continuing to lead

377
00:17:44,633 --> 00:17:47,433
她在上海的金星舞蹈团
Tā zài Shànghǎi de Jīn Xīng wǔdǎo tuán
Her Jin Xing Dance Company in Shanghai

378
00:17:47,433 --> 00:17:50,733
我觉得她一直是一个很有想法的人
Wǒ juéde tā yīzhí shì yī gè hěn yǒu xiǎngfǎ de rén
I think she’s always been a person with great ideas

379
00:17:50,900 --> 00:17:54,233
即使在中国做变性手术
Jíshǐ zài Zhōngguó zuò biànxìng shǒushù
Even when doing gender reassignment surgery in China

380
00:17:54,233 --> 00:17:55,800
继续做舞蹈
Jìxù zuò wǔdǎo
She continued to dance

381
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:57,500
作为变性的舞蹈家
Zuòwéi biànxìng de wǔdǎo jiā
As a transgender dancer

382
00:17:57,500 --> 00:18:01,266
被大家接受一直是一件很难的事情
Bèi dàjiā jiēshòu yīzhí shì yī jiàn hěn nán de shìqíng
Being accepted by everyone has always been very difficult

383
00:18:01,466 --> 00:18:03,333
可是她还是坚持
Kěshì tā háishì jiānchí
But she still persisted

384
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:04,600
所以我相信
Suǒyǐ wǒ xiāngxìn
So I believe

385
00:18:04,600 --> 00:18:06,300
她以后也还是会
Tā yǐhòu yě háishì huì
She will still

386
00:18:06,300 --> 00:18:09,000
坚持做自己相信的事情
Jiānchí zuò zìjǐ xiāngxìn de shìqíng
Persist in doing what she believes in

387
00:18:09,100 --> 00:18:11,300
她很有自己的看法
Tā hěn yǒu zìjǐ de kànfǎ
She has her own perspective

388
00:18:11,300 --> 00:18:13,233
她也不在意别人的观点
Tā yě bù zài yì bié rén de guāndiǎn
She doesn’t care about others’ opinions

389
00:18:13,233 --> 00:18:14,033
那金星呢
Nà Jīn Xīng ne
As for Jin Xing

390
00:18:14,033 --> 00:18:17,466
是在中国一个很特别的人物
Shì zài Zhōngguó yī gè hěn tèbié de rénwù
She is a very special figure in China

391
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:22,100
我其实很期待看到她一些新的作品
Wǒ qíshí hěn qídài kàn dào tā yīxiē xīn de zuòpǐn
I’m actually looking forward to seeing some of her new works

392
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:24,133
或者新的视频
Huòzhě xīn de shìpín
Or new videos

393
00:18:24,566 --> 00:18:27,333
你呢你对这个人物怎么看
Nǐ ne nǐ duì zhège rénwù zěnme kàn
How about you? What do you think of this person?

394
00:18:27,433 --> 00:18:29,400
你喜欢她的故事吗
Nǐ xǐhuān tā de gùshì ma
Do you like her story?

395
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:33,000
你觉得你可以从她的身上学到什么
Nǐ juéde nǐ kěyǐ cóng tā de shēnshàng xué dào shénme
What do you think you can learn from her?

396
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:37,533
还有你喜欢这样的故事类的视频吗
Hái yǒu nǐ xǐhuān zhèyàng de gùshì lèi de shìpín ma
And do you enjoy these types of story-based videos?

397
00:18:37,933 --> 00:18:41,866
我以后会给大家讲更多的人物故事
Wǒ yǐhòu huì gěi dàjiā jiǎng gèng duō de rénwù gùshì
In the future, I will share more stories of people with you

398
00:18:41,866 --> 00:18:44,300
今天就到这里下次见
Jīntiān jiù dào zhè lǐ xià cì jiàn
That’s it for today, see you next time

